@template dreamy
// ZW1 (writer), patch 0.92.3 item 26: crew comment when you wear dirty clothes. clothes.remark: yesterday's clothes
// (flag:clothes.stale); clothes.grubby: a grubby uniform (flag:clothes.grubby, AC3). Bubbles, 60 characters or fewer.
// Kind, never mean: the joke is on the clothes, not on you.
== clothes.remark
? flag:clothes.stale
- Yesterday's clothes. They've got a whole day in them.
- That shirt's seen a sunrise already. Well, a shift.
? flag:clothes.stale tier>=friend
- Clean clothes feel like a new page. You'll see.   #warm
== clothes.grubby
? flag:clothes.grubby
- You've got a little map of oil on you. Pretty, almost.
- Is that grime? It looks like a tiny nebula.   #funny
? flag:clothes.grubby tier>=friend
- Go and change. Then tell me what made all that.   #warm
